OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start to the day with
OL,6,Fsome rain quickly clearing the east
OL,7,Fcoast. Bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fthroughout the afternoon and feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant in the sunshine though breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBecoming cloudier through
OL,12,Fthis evening with a band of rain
OL,13,Fpushing through overnight, clearing
OL,14,Fmost places by dawn. Breezy and
OL,15,Ffeeling less mild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA bright start with cloud
OL,18,Fbubbling up, leaving a mixture of
OL,19,Fsunny spells and a scattering of
OL,20,Fshowers. These turning heavy at times
OL,21,Fwith the risk of thunder and hail.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
